; The core's entire public surface.
;
; A .def rather than __declspec(dllexport) so both architectures
; export the same plain names: on x86 an extern "C" __cdecl symbol
; is `_KryotoO_Startup` in the object file, and the proxy asks
; GetProcAddress for `KryotoO_Startup`. The linker reconciles the
; two here; a dllexport attribute would leave that to convention.
;
; Adding a name is an ABI change. Bump KRYOTOO_ABI_VERSION with it.
EXPORTS
    KryotoO_AbiVersion
    KryotoO_Startup
    KryotoO_LoadPlugins
    KryotoO_InstallSpoofHooks
    KryotoO_InitPlugins
    KryotoO_Shutdown
